'''Soul Suckers'''  float towards Isaac and, upon death, spawn a swirling red vortex, which then fires four {{i|Brimstone}} beams in the cardinal directions after a short delay.

==== Notes ====
* The Brimstone beams fired from the Soul Suckers can damage other enemies, including other Soul Suckers.
* The appearance of the vortex resembles the same vortex that appears when firing {{i|Brimstone}} with the effects of {{i|Anti-Gravity}}.
* {{dlc|r}} They can spawn in unique {{r|Devil Room}} layouts if Isaac is holding the {{t|Number Magnet|n}}.
